1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:03,150
♪ Nobody knows ♪

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,920
♪ The trouble I've seen ♪

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:10,260
♪ Glory, hallelujah. ♪

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,990
(Penny:)Something got you down,
there, Sheldon?

5
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,630
(Sheldon:)Leonard kicked me out
of my own apartment.

6
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:17,830
(Sheldon:)And his app team.

7
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,970
(Penny:)Oh, honey, I'm sorry.

8
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,850
(Sheldon:)He wouldn't drive me
to work today.

9
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:24,020
(Sheldon:)I had to wear
my bus pants.

10
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,940
- Is that so?
- Yes.

11
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,340
(Sheldon:)And they're
still sticky.

12
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,510
(Sheldon:)Aw...

13
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,610
(Sheldon:)Probably going to have
to throw them away.

14
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:35,150
(Penny:)Hey, you don't need
Leonard and his app.

15
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,420
(Penny:)You can make one with me.

16
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,190
(Raj:)With you?

17
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:42,260
(Penny:)Seriously,
I have a great idea for one.

18
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:44,790
(Sheldon:)Is it better than your idea
to move to Los Angeles

19
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:46,490
(Sheldon:)and become a famous actress?

20
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:49,440
(Penny:)Okay, look...

21
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,340
(Penny:)when you see someone
wearing shoes you like,

22
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,720
(Penny:)you just snap a picture of them,

23
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,260
(Penny:)and the app goes on the Internet

24
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,790
(Penny:)to find out
where you can buy them.

25
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:58,090
(Sheldon:)That's your app idea?

26
00:00:58,090 --> 00:00:59,030
(Penny:)Well, you don't like it?

